This is Unity Tower.{VAR BE01}
Trainers from all over the world cross
borders and oceans to gather here.{VAR BE01}
Visit whichever floor you like!{VAR BE01}
The more people you know worldwide,
the more floors you can visit.{VAR BE01}
Please enjoy all that we have to offer!

Awesome! The ceiling is sooo high!{VAR BE01}
I wonder how many of me
you'd have to stack up to reach it?

You're a new face.
Is this your first time here?{VAR BE01}
Unity Tower is the place where
Trainers come from all over the world.{VAR BE01}
That's why I work hard every day doing
security checks to protect those{VAR BE00}
young Trainers.{VAR BE01}
Don't loiter around here
and cause trouble.{VAR BE00}
...'Kay, you can pass.{VAR BE01}

Seems like I've met you somewhere...
Anyway, don't get too wound up and fall.{VAR BE01}
When guests get hurt, it causes me
no end of trouble.{VAR BE01}
...'Kay, you can pass.{VAR BE01}

Oh! So you're a Trainer, then!{VAR BE01}
I see. You're far from family
and traveling the world, huh?{VAR BE01}
I suppose it's fine if you contact them
once in a while.{VAR BE01}
'Kay, you can pass.{VAR BE01}

Oh, it's you.{VAR BE01}
Hmm... You like trading, do you now?{VAR BE01}
Well, that's all right, isn't it.
You're active--just like a young person{VAR BE00}
should be.{VAR BE01}
'Kay, you can pass.{VAR BE01}

Oh, it's you.{VAR BE01}
Seems like you come here a lot.
Do you have friends all over the world?{VAR BE01}
I'd never have imagined a world like this
when I was young.{VAR BE01}
'Kay, you can pass.{VAR BE01}

Oh, it's you, {VAR 0100 0003}!{VAR BE01}
Lately, lots of Trainers have been
looking for you.{VAR BE00}
You're just like a movie star, aren't ya?{VAR BE01}
When I was your age, the ladies
used to get worked up over me. Ha ha.{VAR BE01}
'Kay, you can pass.{VAR BE01}

Hey, it's you, {VAR 0100 0003}!{VAR BE01}
Recently, it looks like there have been
lots of global Trainers like you.{VAR BE01}
That means--how do I put it--world peace
can't be far off!{VAR BE00}
Should I get my hopes up?{VAR BE01}
'Kay, pass on through!{VAR BE01}

Oh, it's you, {VAR 0100 0003}!{VAR BE01}
It feels like since you've started
coming, Unity Tower has gotten busier.{VAR BE01}
There's been a lot more work for this
old guy, but that's a problem I'm{VAR BE00}
happy to have.{VAR BE01}
Keep up the good work!{VAR BE01}

Hey, {VAR 0100 0003}.{VAR BE01}
You've managed to trade with folks in
even more places, huh?{VAR BE01}
That's really something!
I'd imagine your Pokédex is getting{VAR BE00}
pretty full, then?{VAR BE01}
Wow, you're amazing!
'Kay, pass on through.{VAR BE01}

Hey, {VAR 0100 0003}.{VAR BE01}
Unity Tower is as lively as ever
with people who come here to see you.{VAR BE01}
Well, enjoy yourself today!{VAR BE01}

Why, if it isn't {VAR 0100 0003}!
What? F-fifty countries?!{VAR BE01}
I've never seen a Trainer who has traded
with folks in over 50 countries!{VAR BE01}
How in the world did you manage that?{VAR BE01}
'Kay, please pass through--and feel free
to wander around!{VAR BE01}

Hey, it's you, {VAR 0100 0003}.{VAR BE01}
