must have friends all over the world!{VAR BE01}
Ha ha. If you go on a trip, no worries
about not knowing anyone, huh?{VAR BE01}
'Kay, please pass through!{VAR BE01}

Why, if it isn't {VAR 0100 0003}!{VAR BE01}
